/RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:10.1.5" xfa:spec="2.1" style="text-align:left;font-family:Arial;font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000000;text-valign:top;"><p><span>Trzeba wpisa&#263; swoj&#261; konfiguracj&#281;. &#346;cie&#380;ka do scripts powinna by&#263; te&#380;. Najlepiej sprawdzi&#263; wywo&#322;uj&#261;c openocd.exe w terminalu z konfiguracj&#261;.&#13;</span></p><p><span>U mnie dzia&#322;aj&#261; opcje openOCD podstawowe:&#13;</span></p><p><span>&#13;</span></p><p style="font-size:6pt;color:#005500;"><span>-s C:\\Espressif\\tools\\openocd-esp32\\v0.12.0-esp32-20250707\\openocd-esp32\\share\\openocd\\scripts -f interface/ftdi/esp_ftdi.cfg -f  target/esp32.cfg  -c &quot;adapter speed 400&quot;&#13;</span></p><p><span>&#13;</span></p><p><span>mo&#380;na te&#380; doda&#263;:&#13;</span></p><p style="font-size:6pt;color:#005500;"><span>-c &quot;init&quot; -c &quot;reset halt&quot; -c &quot;esp32.cpu0 configure -rtos FreeRTOS&quot; -c &quot;esp32.cpu1 configure -rtos FreeRTOS&quot; -c &quot;set ESP_RTOS none&quot;&#13;</span></p><p><span>&#13;</span></p><p><span>Zwi&#281;kszenie pr&#281;dko&#347;ci do:&#13;</span></p><p style="font-size:6pt;color:#005500;"><span> -c &quot;adapter speed 2000&quot; &lt;---- te&#380; dzia&#322;a&#13;</span></p><p style="font-size:6pt;color:#004040;"><span>&#13;</span></p><p style="font-size:6pt;color:#004040;"><span>&#13;</span></p><p style="font-size:6pt;color:#004040;"><span>&#13;</span></p><p style="font-size:6pt;color:#004040;"><span>&#13;</span></p><p style="font-size:6pt;color:#004040;"><span>&#13;</span></p><p><span>&#346;cie&#380;k&#281; GDB te&#380; trzeba sprawdzi&#263;.</span></p></body>)
/Rect [466.745483 28.808167 591.21106 313.067596]
